	"system": {
		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p><strong>Usage</strong> drawn on a rune </p><hr><p>The wavy lines of this diacritic seem to stretch the base rune into a wider area. When you draw this rune, choose a trigger that when met will invoke the base rune, using the same restrictions as for the trigger of a Ready action. When the trigger is met, you can Invoke the base Rune as a reaction; you can't invoke any additional runes with that reaction. If you define complicated conditions, as determined by the GM, the trigger might fail.</p><hr><p><strong>Special</strong> You can have only one nesh-, diacritic rune of contingency applied at a given time, and once you invoke it, you can't etch or trace it again for 10 minutes.</p>"
		},
